@baseUrl = http://localhost:5223

### Successful email OTP request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "amr.ahmed@example.com"
}

### Unknown email returns the same generic success response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "unknown@example.com"
}

### Unknown phone returns the same generic success response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "+201234567890"
}

### Invalid email returns validation errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "invalid@example"
}

### Invalid phone returns validation errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "+20123abc"
}
